# Apixaban + 4 MeOH Born-Oppenheimer molecular dynamics (short version)
# Starting geometry: Apixaban + 4 MeOH initial cluster (built via solvent_swap.py from Explicit4H2O)
# Total atoms: 83
# Target test trajectory: 0.15 ps (300 steps x 0.5 fs)

! MD r2SCAN-3c TightSCF

%pal
  nprocs 4
end

%maxcore 1500

%md
  Timestep 0.5_fs
  Initvel 298.15_K
  Thermostat NHC 298.15_K Timecon 20.0_fs
  Dump Position Stride 10 Filename "Apixaban_4MeOH_MD.xyz"
  Run 300
end

* xyzfile 0 1 Apixaban_Explicit4MeOH_initial_check.xyz
